 Asia/Tehran    | week         | 1402-12-26 00:00:00+03:30
 Asia/Tehran    | day          | 1403-01-01 00:00:00+03:30
 Asia/Tehran    | hour         | 1403-01-01 00:00:00+03:30
 Asia/Tehran    | minute       | 1403-01-01 00:30:00+03:30
 Asia/Tehran    | second       | 1403-01-01 00:30:00+03:30
 Asia/Tehran    | milliseconds | 1403-01-01 00:30:00+03:30
 Asia/Tehran    | microseconds | 1403-01-01 00:30:00+03:30
 Asia/Kolkata   | year         | 1403-01-01 00:00:00+05:30
 Asia/Kolkata   | quarter      | 1403-01-01 00:00:00+05:30
 Asia/Kolkata   | month        | 1403-01-01 00:00:00+05:30
 Asia/Kolkata   | week         | 1402-12-26 00:00:00+05:30
 Asia/Kolkata   | day          | 1403-01-01 00:00:00+05:30
 Asia/Kolkata   | hour         | 1403-01-01 02:00:00+05:30
 Asia/Kolkata   | minute       | 1403-01-01 02:30:00+05:30
 Asia/Kolkata   | second       | 1403-01-01 02:30:00+05:30
 Asia/Kolkata   | milliseconds | 1403-01-01 02:30:00+05:30
 Asia/Kolkata   | microseconds | 1403-01-01 02:30:00+05:30
 Asia/Kathmandu | year         | 1403-01-01 00:00:00+05:45
 Asia/Kathmandu | quarter      | 1403-01-01 00:00:00+05:45
 Asia/Kathmandu | month        | 1403-01-01 00:00:00+05:45
