 second       | infinity | -infinity | infinity | -infinity | infinity      | -infinity
 milliseconds | infinity | -infinity | infinity | -infinity | infinity      | -infinity
 microseconds | infinity | -infinity | infinity | -infinity | infinity      | -infinity
 decade       | infinity | -infinity | infinity | -infinity | infinity      | -infinity
 century      | infinity | -infinity | infinity | -infinity | infinity      | -infinity
 millennium   | infinity | -infinity | infinity | -infinity | infinity      | -infinity
(13 rows)

